  {
   "children": [],
   "content_layer": "body",
   "formatting": {
    "bold": false,
    "italic": false,
    "script": "baseline",
    "strikethrough": false,
    "underline": false
   },
   "label": "text",
   "orig": "Two risks need attention. First, the cold-chain corridor depends on a single carrier and any interruption would delay roughly 900 shipments per week. Second, the new scanning stations are running firmware 2.4.1, which has a known issue with duplicate labels. A remediation plan is due on 15 November 2026 and will be tracked weekly.",
   "parent": {
    "$ref": "#/texts/7"
   },
   "prov": [],
   "self_ref": "#/texts/8",
   "text": "Two risks need attention. First, the cold-chain corridor depends on a single carrier and any interruption would delay roughly 900 shipments per week. Second, the new scanning stations are running firmware 2.4.1, which has a known issue with duplicate labels. A remediation plan is due on 15 November 2026 and will be tracked weekly."
  },
  {
   "children": [],
